bs.twimg.com/media/GnOACrNXwAADN_-.jpg:large"></p><p>Peter Wildeford 🇺🇸🚀 (@peterwildeford) on X</p><p>This theory of AI displacement mainly being in not rehiring workers that leave makes sense to me. Here’s a good FRED data series to track this: total Professional and Business Services job openings. No sign of AI yet.</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/peterwildeford/status/1906009015101919708">https://x.com/peterwildeford/status/1906009015101919708</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/monday-assorted-links-502.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=monday-assorted-links-502">Monday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/peterwildeford/status/1906009015101919708</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/peterwildeford/status/1906009015101919708</guid><pubDate>Mon, 31 Mar 2025 15:43:56 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[AI art is more likely to look like this than like Rembrandt]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GnTKI4maQAAtVh9.jpg:large"></p><p>Emad (@EMostaque) on X</p><p>GPT 4o’s unhinged reflections on generative ai</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/EMostaque/status/1906370813739274388">https://x.com/EMostaque/status/1906370813739274388</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/monday-assorted-links-502.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=monday-assorted-links-502">Monday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/EMostaque/status/1906370813739274388</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/EMostaque/status/1906370813739274388</guid><pubDate>Mon, 31 Mar 2025 15:43:56 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[A poll on which is your favorite Odyssey translation]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1857140980421668864/0prdKK32_200x200.jpg"></p><p>Nabeel S. Qureshi (@nabeelqu) on X</p><p>Doing an experiment. Below are four tr